      "kind": "narrative",
      "text": "I’d favor the Turkish Airlines business-cabin award if an earlier Bangkok arrival and the reported business cabin are worth the extra points to you. The tradeoff is substantial: it requires 275,000 Turkish Miles & Smiles points rather than 110,000 for the economy award, and neither option has reliable seat-count or award-tax information in these search results. Both also require a separate SFO–LAX cash flight before the award; protection or bookability across that connection is unverified.",
